          "short": "$31-12\\sqrt3$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3\\sqrt3-2)^2&=(3\\sqrt3)^2-2(3\\sqrt3)(2)+2^2\\\\(3\\sqrt3-2)^2&=27-12\\sqrt3+4\\\\(3\\sqrt3-2)^2&=31-12\\sqrt3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
